WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.126 --> 00:00:02.921
(sloshing)

00:00:02.921 --> 00:00:04.334
- [Narrator] Until 60 years ago,

00:00:04.334 --> 00:00:07.422
all soy sauce was made like this

00:00:07.422 --> 00:00:10.172
and it tasted totally different.

00:00:10.172 --> 00:00:13.802
But there's a small island
off the eastern coast of Japan

00:00:13.802 --> 00:00:18.264
with a town center called
the Country of Soy Sauce.

00:00:18.264 --> 00:00:20.519
Here, despite a government ordinance

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:23.437
to modernize production,
a small group of people

00:00:23.437 --> 00:00:26.190
continue to make it the traditional way.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.282
(light music)

00:00:29.282 --> 00:00:32.449
Yasuo Yamamoto is one of those people.

00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:38.910
(upbeat music)

00:00:40.622 --> 00:00:44.539
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:06.688 --> 00:01:09.313
Yamamoto isn't doing this alone.

00:01:09.313 --> 00:01:11.037
A few of the people who help him,

00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:14.318
Mr. Sakaguchi, carpenter and craftsman,

00:01:14.318 --> 00:01:17.410
Ms. Takahashi, head assistant,

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.952
Ms. Taguchi, head of shipping,

00:01:19.952 --> 00:01:23.243
Ms. Yoshioka, in charge
of soy bottle labeling.

00:01:23.243 --> 00:01:25.166
Oh, and this is our cab driver.

00:01:25.166 --> 00:01:26.625
He drove us here.

00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:30.542
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:48.769 --> 00:01:52.860
Instead of using steel, he
uses large bamboo barrels

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:55.610
and means he has to make himself.

00:01:59.867 --> 00:02:02.409
These barrels are the main
differentiating factor

00:02:02.409 --> 00:02:06.120
between the soy sauce you know and his.

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:09.288
It ultimately comes down to how
the soy beans are fermenting

00:02:09.288 --> 00:02:12.256
inside these bamboo barrels.

00:02:12.256 --> 00:02:15.257
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:15.257 --> 00:02:17.507
(sloshing)

00:02:19.718 --> 00:02:23.635
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:31.734 --> 00:02:33.773
Traditional commercial
production of soy sauce

00:02:33.773 --> 00:02:35.947
takes only a few months.

00:02:35.947 --> 00:02:38.239
But for Yamamoto, it takes much longer.

00:02:38.239 --> 00:02:42.156
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:05.519 --> 00:03:08.560
It seems like a lot of work
to go through for soy sauce.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:09.604
But for Yamamoto,

00:03:09.604 --> 00:03:13.776
this is what soy sauce is
supposed to taste like.

00:03:13.776 --> 00:03:15.025
So it's all worth it.

00:03:15.025 --> 00:03:18.942
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:21.322 --> 00:03:23.825
Yamamoto-san, whose soy sauce is better?

00:03:23.825 --> 00:03:25.578
Yours or the big guys?

00:03:25.578 --> 00:03:28.123
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:28.123 --> 00:03:30.790
(gentle music)

